    "name": "I Hate Robots",
    "steam_appid": 914740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914740/extras/9ed430dd8ea0dc0b55703781af0416e1.poster.avif?t=1754375942\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914740/extras/9ed430dd8ea0dc0b55703781af0416e1.webm?t=1754375942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914740/extras/9ed430dd8ea0dc0b55703781af0416e1.mp4?t=1754375942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>I Hate Robots</strong> \u2013 a dark action-shooter in a sci-fi setting.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a scientist-researcher sent to a planet inhabited by robots. Your mission is to collect samples of living machines for study, but upon arrival, you find neither your colleagues nor the samples. Now, you must venture into dangerous portals to locate the necessary materials while facing hostile machines that will do everything to destroy you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse levels</strong> with unique objectives: survival, exploration, and scientific artifact retrieval.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An arsenal of 6 weapons</strong> for eliminating enemies, each with distinct features and firing modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dozens of robot types</strong> and their modifications\u2014from small reconnaissance drones to turrets and kamikaze spiders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark atmospheric sci-fi environments</strong>, filled with tension and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging gameplay</strong>\u2014limited resources, constant pressure, and the need for vigilance.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are you ready to step into the unknown?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every move could be your last. Will you manage to collect the samples and survive among machines that despise the living?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914740/extras/e52f2e9f5755f105eada5cd712f11fab.poster.avif?t=1754375942\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914740/extras/e52f2e9f5755f105eada5cd712f11fab.webm?t=1754375942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914740/extras/e52f2e9f5755f105eada5cd712f11fab.mp4?t=1754375942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914740/extras/9ed430dd8ea0dc0b55703781af0416e1.poster.avif?t=1754375942\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914740/extras/9ed430dd8ea0dc0b55703781af0416e1.webm?t=1754375942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914740/extras/9ed430dd8ea0dc0b55703781af0416e1.mp4?t=1754375942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>I Hate Robots</strong> \u2013 a dark action-shooter in a sci-fi setting.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a scientist-researcher sent to a planet inhabited by robots. Your mission is to collect samples of living machines for study, but upon arrival, you find neither your colleagues nor the samples. Now, you must venture into dangerous portals to locate the necessary materials while facing hostile machines that will do everything to destroy you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse levels</strong> with unique objectives: survival, exploration, and scientific artifact retrieval.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An arsenal of 6 weapons</strong> for eliminating enemies, each with distinct features and firing modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dozens of robot types</strong> and their modifications\u2014from small reconnaissance drones to turrets and kamikaze spiders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark atmospheric sci-fi environments</strong>, filled with tension and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging gameplay</strong>\u2014limited resources, constant pressure, and the need for vigilance.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are you ready to step into the unknown?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every move could be your last. Will you manage to collect the samples and survive among machines that despise the living?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914740/extras/e52f2e9f5755f105eada5cd712f11fab.poster.avif?t=1754375942\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914740/extras/e52f2e9f5755f105eada5cd712f11fab.webm?t=1754375942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914740/extras/e52f2e9f5755f105eada5cd712f11fab.mp4?t=1754375942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
